    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "VOLTORB was first sighted at a company\nthat manufactures POKé BALLS.\nThe link between that sighting and\fthe fact that this POKéMON looks very\nsimilar to a POKé BALL remains a\nmystery.",
      "language": {
